    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit",
        "text": "Let me repeat myself, old boy. I could just break your leg and come in all the same."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "You've already come searching before! What're you here for now?! We can't even afford your taxes anymore! What more do you want to wring out of us?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_082"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit",
        "text": "This is a routine inspection! We don't care how you try to sweeten the pot this time, we're mandated to inspect every two years... If we don't carry this out, then we're all in for the whip."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit",
        "text": "But if you just consent..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "We can't give anything anymore! We've got nothing to give! No money, no jewelry, not even any more food!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_082"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit",
        "text": "The hell are you going on for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit",
        "text": "This is a routine inspection! Out of the way!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_092#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Man",
        "text": "Sir, sir! Officer, sir, we've got nothing left to give, honest to heaven! If you need to take something with you, just take me, for God's sakes!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_082"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Infected Patrol Unit",
        "text": "I said OUT OF THE WAY!"
    },
